{{! cas-replace-value-guard: guide section 14.2's value-based CAS for
    NoBoundary targets, whose values live in the family's dal:dataGraph
    (H2.7, TD-43). Guards on the OLD value of the guard property
    (compile-time Mustache slot guardProperty), not on a version row: no
    aggregate exists to whole-graph replace here.

    Note for template authors: never put a Mustache tag inside this
    comment block. Chevron's comment parser ends at the first closing double-brace it
    sees, even one nested inside a triple-brace tag, which silently
    truncates the comment and corrupts everything after it -- this was
    caught by this template's own render-and-parse test. }}
PREFIX pat: <https://example.org/lattice/patterns#>

DELETE { GRAPH {{{dataGraph}}} { $root {{{guardProperty}}} $oldValue } }
INSERT { GRAPH {{{dataGraph}}} { $root {{{guardProperty}}} $newValue } }
WHERE  { GRAPH {{{dataGraph}}} { $root {{{guardProperty}}} $oldValue } }
